<section class="connections passage" id="practice" aria-labelledby="practice-title">
 <div class="connections-still">
  <canvas class="neural-field" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <p class="scene-kicker">The work changed. The pattern didn’t.</p>
  <h2 id="practice-title">Different systems.<br/><em>Same instinct.</em></h2>
  <div class="mind-regions" aria-label="Explore six connected capabilities">
   {capabilities.map((area,i)=><button type="button" data-region={i} aria-label={`Explore ${area.label}`} aria-expanded="false" aria-controls={`region-detail-${i}`}><b>{area.label}</b><span>{area.fragment}</span><i aria-hidden="true">+</i></button>)}
  </div>
  <svg class="region-connector" aria-hidden="true"><path/></svg>
  {capabilities.map((area,i)=><section class="region-disclosure" id={`region-detail-${i}`} data-region-panel={i} hidden aria-labelledby={`region-title-${i}`}>
   <button class="region-close" type="button" aria-label={`Close ${area.label}`}>×</button>
   <p class="region-register">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')} / {area.label}</p>
   <h3 id={`region-title-${i}`} tabindex="-1">{area.title}</h3>
   <div class="region-reading"><p class="region-intro">{area.intro}</p><p>{area.detail}</p><p class="region-evidence">{area.evidence}</p><a href={area.href}>{area.link}</a></div>
  </section>)}
  <p class="mind-caption">Different parts.<br/><em>The connections do the work.</em></p>
  <div class="practice-under"><details><summary><span class="plus">+</span> Follow the connection</summary><div class="disclosed"><p>At Olympic Park: people, routes and crowd flow. At Nasdaq and West: clients, websites and integrations. In independent crypto projects: software and delivery.</p><p>At Ledger Enterprise: commercial workflows, data management and revenue projections. At Blockdaemon: revenue operations, BI, CRM/data workflows and cross-functional analysis.</p><p>Revenue Intelligence makes that commercial-information layer explorable. CIOS connects projects, evidence, people and next actions, with AI findings kept open to human review.</p></div></details></div>
  <a class="neural-next" href="#evidence">From connections to something real ↓</a>
 </div>
</section>
