  <h2 id="building-title">And then,<br/>build the <em>next thing.</em></h2>
  <div class="building-copy"><h3>CIOS</h3><p>An idea needs a way through.<br/><em>And people to move it.</em></p><details><summary><span class="plus">+</span> Open the system underneath</summary><div class="disclosed"><p class="disclosure-label">Collective Intelligence Operating System</p><p>Projects, briefs, stakeholders, funding pathways, partner research and next actions, connected in one working system.</p><p>AI researches, compares and drafts. People review the findings and accept what becomes part of the project.</p><p>The implementation uses Next.js / TypeScript, FastAPI and PostgreSQL. Its hackathon work adds Google ADK and Gemini investigator workflows to an existing product foundation.</p><p>Built as an ongoing product, with a public hackathon demonstration.</p></div></details><a class="cios-enter" href="https://cios-mvp-frontend-staging-921183510318.europe-central2.run.app/demo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore the hackathon app ↗</a></div>
